# Generated output. Files already tracked here (the analysis figures and
# tables that docs/reports/*.md link to) stay tracked and keep showing their
# diffs -- .gitignore only affects untracked paths. This stops new training
# artifacts, checkpoints and sweep runs from being added by accident.
# To commit a genuinely new analysis artifact: git add -f output/<path>
output/
